>I agree with David and Richard.  The solution is not to improve the current
>move commands (by confirmation or whatever), but to separate them from
>the attack commands.  I think f-<dir> for fighting is a fine idea.  I
>don't really see the need for a fight mode.  It also doesn't seem like that
