Thanks for the support!  I'm definitely in favor of a fight mode, though.
Remember rogue?  I hated hitting that spacebar after every hit.

Seems to me someone suggested you could have both:

	f<dir>		attack once, remain in move mode
	F		switch to fight mode (takes 0 turns)
	m<dir>		move once, remain in fight mode
	M		switch to move mode (takes 0 turns)

Or perhaps the same command (F or whatever) could toggle the modes.


